<section class="section about-hero">
  <div class="container text-center" style="max-width: 820px;">
    <h6 class="eyebrow text-muted">About Tulia</h6>
    <h1 class="section-title text-primary italic-serif">The Flow of Rebirth</h1>
    <div class="divider mx-auto"></div>
    <p class="section-subtitle" style="font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.8;">TULIA was born from a simple belief: skincare should work with the natural rhythm of your skin, not against it. Born in India and created with a global perspective, TULIA brings together considered formulations, purposeful ingredients and modern skincare rituals designed around what your skin actually needs. Because what touches your skin matters.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section bg-surface-alt">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 820px;">
    <h6 class="eyebrow text-muted">Our Belief</h6>
    <h2 class="section-title text-primary italic-serif" style="font-size: 2.2rem;">We wanted to make skincare more considered</h2>
    <div class="divider"></div>
    <p style="line-height: 1.8; color: var(--on-surface-variant);">Beauty often asks us to add more: more products, more steps and more promises. We chose to look closer instead. Every TULIA formulation begins with purpose, considering what belongs in the formula, why it belongs there and how it can meaningfully support the skin. Because skincare should not be about fixing who you are, but caring for the skin you have.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="about-cards">
      <div class="about-card">
        <h6 class="eyebrow text-muted">Our Vision</h6>
        <h3 class="italic-serif text-primary">To make conscious skincare the new luxury</h3>
        <div class="divider"></div>
        <p>We envision a world where people understand what they put on their skin and choose skincare with intention. Where beautiful formulations are valued not only for how they look, but for what they contain, how they perform and how naturally they fit into everyday life. For us, conscious skincare means better ingredients, better understanding and better choices.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="about-card">
        <h6 class="eyebrow text-muted">Our Mission</h6>
        <h3 class="italic-serif text-primary">To create skincare with purpose</h3>
        <div class="divider"></div>
        <p>We create thoughtful, ingredient-led formulations designed to address real skin needs while making everyday skincare feel elevated. From formulation to experience, every decision is guided by purpose, performance and skin-first care, creating products that feel considered from the inside out.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section bg-surface-alt">
  <div class="container text-center" style="max-width: 820px;">
    <h6 class="eyebrow text-muted">Our Roots</h6>
    <h2 class="section-title text-primary italic-serif" style="font-size: 2.2rem;">Born in India, made for the world</h2>
    <div class="divider mx-auto"></div>
    <p style="line-height: 1.8; color: var(--on-surface-variant);">TULIA began in India, but our vision has always extended beyond geography. Our approach recognises that skin and hair are shaped by different environments, lifestyles and everyday experiences. While our roots influence where we began, our commitment to thoughtful formulation allows us to evolve with the needs of people everywhere.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section about-rebirth">
  <div class="container text-center" style="max-width: 820px;">
    <h6 class="eyebrow text-muted">The Rebirth</h6>
    <h2 class="section-title text-primary italic-serif" style="font-size: 2.2rem;">A new chapter, a clearer purpose.</h2>
    <div class="divider mx-auto"></div>
    <p style="line-height: 1.8; color: var(--on-surface-variant); margin-bottom: 2rem;">Rebirth represents the next chapter of TULIA and a renewed commitment to how we formulate, create and care. Our evolution goes beyond a new look, bringing together more thoughtful choices, considered formulations and a deeper understanding of what we put on our skin. As TULIA moves forward, one belief remains at the heart of everything we do: be conscious of what touches your skin.</p>
    <a href="{{ routes.collections_url }}/all-products" class="btn btn-primary">Explore the Collection</a>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-hero { padding-top: 4rem; }
  .about-cards { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 24px; }
  .about-card { background: #fcf9f8; border: 1px solid var(--outline-variant); border-radius: 12px; padding: 2.5rem 2rem; }
  .about-card h3 { font-size: 1.6rem; line-height: 1.3; margin-bottom: 0; }
  .about-card p { line-height: 1.8; color: var(--on-surface-variant); margin-bottom: 0; }
  @media screen and (max-width: 768px) {
    .about-cards { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .about-hero { padding-top: 2.5rem; }
  }
</style>

